
@startuml View Screening Seats Sequence

actor User
participant UI
participant ScreeningController
participant ScreeningService
participant ScreeningRepository
participant SeatRepository
participant ReservationRepository
database DB

note right of ScreeningService
    **SeatDto**
    --
    long Id
    int Row
    int Number
    SeatStatus Status

    **SeatStatus**
    --
    FREE - Green
    PENDING - Yellow (temporarily held)
    RESERVED - Red (booked)

    Expired PENDING reservations
    are treated as FREE.
end note

User -> UI: Select screening

UI -> ScreeningController: GET /screenings/{screeningId}/seats
activate ScreeningController

ScreeningController -> ScreeningService: getSeats(screeningId)
activate ScreeningService

ScreeningService -> ScreeningRepository: findById(screeningId)
activate ScreeningRepository

ScreeningRepository -> DB: SELECT screening
DB --> ScreeningRepository: Screening

ScreeningRepository --> ScreeningService: Screening (roomId)
deactivate ScreeningRepository

ScreeningService -> SeatRepository: findByRoomId(roomId)
activate SeatRepository

SeatRepository -> DB: SELECT seats
DB --> SeatRepository: List<Seat>

SeatRepository --> ScreeningService: List<Seat>
deactivate SeatRepository

ScreeningService -> ReservationRepository: findActiveByScreeningId(\nscreeningId, activeSince)
activate ReservationRepository

ReservationRepository -> DB: SELECT active reservations
DB --> ReservationRepository: List<Reservation>

ReservationRepository --> ScreeningService: List<Reservation>
deactivate ReservationRepository

ScreeningService -> ScreeningService: Map seats to SeatDto\nAssign seat status

ScreeningService --> ScreeningController: List<SeatDto>
deactivate ScreeningService

ScreeningController --> UI: 200 OK\nList<SeatDto>
deactivate ScreeningController

UI -> UI: Render seating layout\nFREE = green\nPENDING = yellow\nRESERVED = red

note right of UI
    Only FREE seats are clickable.

    PENDING and RESERVED seats
    are displayed but disabled.
end note

UI --> User: Display seating layout\nwith selectable FREE seats

@enduml
